TripHeatMap - Offer Accepted
===============================================

YOUR OFFER WAS ACCEPTED!

Hi <%= @host.first_name.presence.titleize || @host.full_name&.split(' ')&.first.titleize || @host.email.split('@').first.titleize %>,

Great news! Your exclusive offer for <%= @place.name %> has been accepted by a guest.
They will complete the booking through <%= @place.place_type.titleize %> and you can expect their arrival soon.

-----------------------------------------------
BOOKING DETAILS
-----------------------------------------------

Your Property: <%= @place.name %>
<% if @place.address %>               <%= @place.address %>
<% end %>
Offered Price: $<%= @offer.offered_price_cents / 100 %>/night
<% if @offer.discount_value.present? %>               <%= @offer.discount_description %>
<% end %>
Guest's Dates: <%= @offer.saved_search.date_range %>
<% if @offer.saved_search.number_of_guests %>Number of Guests: <%= @offer.saved_search.number_of_guests %>
<% end %>
<% if @offer.perks.present? && @offer.perks.any? %>
Perks You Offered:
<% @offer.perks.each do |perk| %>  ✓ <%= perk %>
<% end %><% end %>

-----------------------------------------------
WHAT HAPPENS NEXT
-----------------------------------------------

1. The guest will complete payment through <%= @place.place_type.titleize %>
2. You'll receive a booking notification from <%= @place.place_type.titleize %>
3. Prepare your property for the guest's arrival
4. Make sure to provide the perks you promised in the offer

VIEW BOOKING DETAILS:
<%= offer_url(@offer) %>

